WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.959 --> 00:00:02.168
-(PHONE RINGS)
-ADAM SHANK: Hello?

00:00:02.252 --> 00:00:04.170
OPERATOR: (OVER PHONE) This call
 is from a federal prison.

00:00:04.379 --> 00:00:06.172
-Here.
-Hello, Mom.

00:00:06.256 --> 00:00:07.757
CINDY SHANK:
 I love you, princess.

00:00:08.550 --> 00:00:10.301
RUDY VALDEZ:
 Do you know why Mommy's there?

00:00:10.802 --> 00:00:13.012
ANNALIS SHANK:
 The kids that lived with her

00:00:13.096 --> 00:00:15.598
were doing bad things,
and that's why she's there,

00:00:15.682 --> 00:00:18.601
'cause she was actually
with those kids.

00:00:19.102 --> 00:00:20.937
CINDY: (ON PHONE)

00:00:30.947 --> 00:00:32.490
ADAM: The minute she heard
 that door knock

00:00:32.574 --> 00:00:34.159
and they said they had a warrant
for her arrest,

00:00:34.242 --> 00:00:36.661
I turned around and saw her,
you know, hugging the kids.

00:00:36.995 --> 00:00:39.122
That was tough,
because she knew already.

00:00:39.789 --> 00:00:41.291
VALDEZ:
I wanna try and tell your story.

00:00:41.499 --> 00:00:43.418
Figure out a way
to make something good

00:00:43.501 --> 00:00:45.462
-out of all of this.
-CINDY: (ON PHONE)

00:00:46.629 --> 00:00:49.966
I remember she always used
to play with me

00:00:50.049 --> 00:00:51.593
and she used to comb my hair.

00:00:52.093 --> 00:00:53.595
CINDY: (ON PHONE)

00:00:56.181 --> 00:00:57.182
AUTUMN SHANK:
 It has been tough

00:00:57.390 --> 00:00:59.851
for the last nine years
without her being here.

00:01:00.435 --> 00:01:01.436
WOMAN:
 There are thousands

00:01:01.519 --> 00:01:04.105
and thousands of people
just like her,

00:01:04.439 --> 00:01:07.859
serving the same
ridiculously insane sentences.

00:01:07.942 --> 00:01:09.778
She did not go to the police
so she was guilty.

00:01:10.278 --> 00:01:11.613
What we cannot
wrap our heads around,

00:01:11.696 --> 00:01:14.574
as a family,
as her brother, as her children,

00:01:14.657 --> 00:01:16.534
is the sentence
that she received.

00:01:16.826 --> 00:01:18.995
CINDY: (ON PHONE)

00:01:22.832 --> 00:01:24.667
CINDY: (ON PHONE)
 I carry your heart, right?

00:01:24.751 --> 00:01:27.170
Mm-hmm. And I carry your heart.

